  lines:
  - speakerName: Boss
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    content: "Bad enough that I\u2019m asking you, not someone else."
    replyOptions: []
    replyBranches: []
    loopQuestion: 0
  - speakerName: Boss
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    content: "It\u2019s the usual kind of trouble. Small things on their own, heavier
      when they start piling together."
    replyOptions: []
    replyBranches: []
    loopQuestion: 0
  - speakerName: Boss
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    content: Either way, the situation is simple.I can give you a lighter load if
      you want to keep things manageable.Or I can hand over the full list and let
      you deal with everything at once.
    replyOptions: []
    replyBranches: []
    loopQuestion: 0
  - speakerName: Boss
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    content: "So. Decide how much you\u2019re taking."
    replyOptions: []
    replyBranches: []
    loopQuestion: 0
